---
// The measurement-first hook. Lives on /baseline (the product page) — the home
// page's consulting equivalent is SoundFamiliar.astro.
---
<section class="bg-tint border-y border-line">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-4xl">
      <p class="text-ink font-bold leading-tight" style="font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 40px);">
        Most shops run on gut feel, paper, and <span class="text-accent">tribal knowledge</span>.
      </p>
      <p class="text-muted text-[16px] leading-relaxed mt-5 max-w-2xl">
        The bottleneck you <em class="not-italic font-semibold text-ink">think</em> you have usually isn't the
        real one — and without data, every automation dollar is a guess.
        <span class="font-semibold text-ink">BASELINE ends the guessing.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
